<title>SOUTH AFRICA: ALLIANCE, FORIM STILL IN TALKS.</title>
<headline>ALLIANCE, FORIM STILL IN TALKS.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alliance Pharmaceuticals Ltd announced on Monday it was still in talks with Forim Holdings Ltd which, if successful, could have an effect on the companies' share prices.</p>
<p>Shareholders were advised to exercise caution in their sharedealings until further notice.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom, +27 11 482-1003</p>
</text>
